WEBVTT

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.000
"Starlight" ...

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:15.870
It's the story of goddesses drawn
by the glow of the heavens.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:22.290
We can fight and argue and disagree,
but there are ties that bind us together...

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:27.160
Yet we may be pulled from one another,
never to meet again. It is a sad story.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:33.120
Let's go! Together, we will grasp that star.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.290
Our dream will not come to be!

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:40.790
That stage, those voices joined in song...

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.790
They can't help but spur us on.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:44.950
Huh?

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.080
Let's go...

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:51.330
To that stage, to that shining star... Together!

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:04.430
Revue Starlight

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:13.200
Ano hoshi o tsukamu no wa daare?
Who, oh who, will be the one to grab hold of the star?

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:20.160
Tou no choujou de
At the very top of that tower

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:34.540
Shizuka ni tomotta honou ga atsuku mune o kogashite iku
These flames lit in silence fill my chest with a white-hot passion

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:36.790
Unmei no wa
That's just the Wheel of Fortune

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:44.500
Butai no ue de odorasareteiru wake ja nai
It's not like I'm being forced to dance on this stage

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.700
Tobitate
Spring forth

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:50.580
Tashika ni ano hi mitanda
I'm sure I saw it that day

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:54.200
Hajiketa hoshi no kirameki
The brilliance of a star that has burst open

00:01:54.200 --> 00:02:00.660
Iroaseta yakusoku ni yubi ga fureru made
Until my fingers reach out to touch that faded promise

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.750
Makuake mae ni hajimaru
It will start before the curtain rises

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:08.290
Me no mae de tsuzurareteku
And be spelled out before our eyes

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:11.870
Umarekawatta watashi wa
Having been reborn

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:15.700
Koko de kimi ni aeta
I was able to meet you here

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:19.330
Mou ichido
Once again

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:33.250
Dear Miss Hikari Kagura...

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:36.250
The days have been cold lately. How have you been?

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:39.870
Karen Aijo, the Stage Girl, is doing well today, as always!

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:40.620
What?

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:41.950
Oh, yeah!

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:46.790
Our performance of "Starlight" for
the 99th Seisho Festival went off without a hitch!

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:50.580
It was my first performance at
the Seisho Music Academy,

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:54.950
but I think we all worked together and
put on a really great performance!

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:58.540
And yet...

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:00.200
I'm still not satisfied.

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:02.950
Next year, I will get the role of Flora!

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:06.450
Once I do, I sure hope you can come and see me...

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.200
As if, right?

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:14.330
Bit by bit, I'm getting closer to that promise
I made you... I'm sure of it!

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:22.950
So, you do the same! Oh, but pushing yourself too
far is a big non non, okay?

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:25.410
I'll write again later.

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:28.750
Yours truly, Karen Aijo.

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:32.700
Well, I'm off.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:39.950
Karen, thank you for all the letters.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:45.000
My lessons always keep me busy,
but I'm still running forward...

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:48.290
Toward you, and the stage we promised we'd share.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.410
So that here... we can become stars!

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:00.200
The Royal Academy of Theatrical Actors.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.250
Stage actors and directors,

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:07.200
scriptwriters, stage designers,
lighting and sound technicians...

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:11.580
everyone who aspires to work in the theater,
you'll find them here.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:18.370
The classes here can be specialized or
cover a general curriculum.

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:24.700
From cutting-edge Performance Arts Theory
to the latest in practical stage construction...

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:28.660
The teachers here are all stage veterans,
offering specialized, high-level courses.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:33.450
My fellow classmates have gathered here from around
the world, competing for the same dream...

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.910
I can't let my guard down for a single moment.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:40.410
Every day is a battle I give my all,
as if I were up there on stage!

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:47.450
I can't let myself settle for regular bit roles.

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:50.790
I need to be better. I have to shine brighter...

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:53.700
And aim for that promised stage.

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:03.040
Hikari-chan! I don't want you to go!

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:06.160
Karen, crybabies can't be stars!

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:07.540
What?!

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:12.160
B-but, Hikari-chan, if you go to Dondon-

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:13.370
It's "London."

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:16.830
I can't do "Starlight" by myself!

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:19.830
Okay, fine.

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:22.200
You won't go to Dondon?!

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:25.370
I won't come back until I've become a star!

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:26.660
So I won't be seeing you either!

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:34.660
Why?! Why?! Why, why?! Why?!

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:36.620
Because when I'm around, you always rely on ME.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:38.870
Oh, come on! Can I call you?

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:39.580
Nope.

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:44.200
Um... Uh, fine. Can I write you?

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:50.450
Hikari-chan, you don't have to write back!
I'll just send mine!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.450
Okay?

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:02.830
Karen.

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:04.750
Hikari-chan...

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:10.040
I'll see you on stage, okay?

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:12.750
Yeah! It's a promise!

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:14.500
You've got it wrong...

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.040
It's fate. Okay?

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:19.870
"Fate"?

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:22.750
Yeah!

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:28.480
Tokyo
Souvenir City

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:32.250
I put on a big show in front of Karen,
but the truth is, that was for my own sake.

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:37.410
If I didn't say it like that and keep my distance...

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:39.200
I'd start to miss her.

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:43.120
"I love the stage. I love 'Starlight.'"

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:45.620
Now that Karen's told me that, I...

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:48.660
I'll keep running.

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:52.290
We'll meet again under that spotlight.

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:55.790
Karen is waiting for me, up on that stage...

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:59.750
So that, together, we can become stars!

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:08.830
That's why I can't settle for the here and now.

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:12.290
More... more... more!

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:14.040
I have to push myself more, go even higher!

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:19.950
Huh?

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:31.500
What is this?

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:33.370
Revues are...

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:38.830
enchanting stage performances with songs and dances.

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:40.830
A-a giraffe?!

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:45.580
Japanese is more suitable, then? I understand.

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:47.330
The Revue...

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:52.330
is song and dance woven into
a mesmerizing stage show.

00:07:54.750 --> 00:08:01.200
In these auditions that will soon start,
the one who presents us with the most dazzling of revues

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:07.580
shall receive the heavenly tiara and find the path to
the Top Star opened before her.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.790
"Top Star"?

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:14.950
She who stands atop the stage of fate...

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:23.660
The one who emits unending "shine," causing her talents
to bloom with a brilliance that transcends time.

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:26.330
It is a role that lasts for eternity.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:30.040
"The stage... of fate"?

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:34.000
Will you participate in this audition?

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.620
I understand.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.910
Karen. I am...

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:46.330
waiting for you...

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.370
on the stage of fate!

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:16.750
It can't be!

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:24.540
This concludes all auditions.

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:37.540
What?

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:44.250
Huh?

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:52.200
What's gotten into Judy?

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.290
She's gotten SO much better lately, huh?

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:57.330
That jump she just did was super pretty!

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:58.700
What were... those auditions all about?

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:11.620
Suppression of the people!

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:16.830
War upon war, a tyrannical emperor...
No longer can I turn a blind eye to these!

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:19.660
What's happened... to me?

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:20.290
We are the "Sworn Allies of the Sword,"

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:23.450
This stage means everything, and yet I feel nothing...

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:24.200
and with God as our witness, we shall bring justice to bear!

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:28.580
The nervousness of standing on the stage,
the euphoria of singing atop it is just...

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:35.540
Those in whom we trust, those closest to our sons...

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:38.080
Even YOU would betray us?!

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:41.290
All the "shine" I feel when I'm on stage... it's gone.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:44.160
But, why?

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:48.870
Even should the day come that we must fight them...

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:54.830
I've... lost it.

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:00.660
Huh?

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:02.540
What?

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:11.450
The 130 grams I lost...

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:14.370
That one jar of hand cream I always used...

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:18.750
The salmon sandwich at Crosstown and
my paperback copy of "Macbeth"...

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:25.040
Eleven two-pound coins,
the weight of one of my kidneys...

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:30.160
What is it of mine... that I've lost?

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:33.870
What's happened to me?

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.620
I feel nothing.

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:43.950
It was as if I were being urged on...
and I was plunging forward.

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:49.080
But now... Now, I can't remember anything.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:59.200
Why... Why did I choose to stand on the stage?

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:02.750
What do I hope to accomplish at that school?

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:05.660
Oh, right. That's it.

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.540
Karen and I made a promi...

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:11.330
Karen.

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:18.790
No way! How could I have done that...
to my promise with Karen?

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:21.660
What's wrong with me?

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:23.950
Did something happen?

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:27.830
"Audition"?

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:32.290
No... I can't!

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:35.790
Answer...

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:37.830
Please answer!

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:40.120
Answer, Giraffe!

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:44.540
I won't allow this!

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:48.540
I can't... go on like this!

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:03.580
In the "Audition,"

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:09.950
the one who presents us with the most dazzling
of revues shall receive the heavenly tiara

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:13.700
and find the path to the Top Star opened before her.

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:17.540
However, if you lose,
everything shall be taken from you...

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:20.160
including your precious "shine."

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:23.290
I understand.

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:27.080
You kept that from me, didn't you?

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:34.000
The birth of the Top Star requires a measure of fuel.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:37.910
That was... the shine that was taken from me?

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:45.120
I could not have predicted you would have
so much still remaining.

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:49.790
And so, I will provide you with one more chance.

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:50.750
Huh?

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:53.250
For your next Audition...

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:57.410
The location shall be... Japan.

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:02.950
In the Audition, the one who presents us
with the most dazzling of revues

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:07.120
shall find the path to the Top Star opened before her.

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:12.370
I can participate again? But, why?

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:16.580
The Stage Girl who has lost it all...

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:22.160
It is a fateful stage, one upon which
no one can predict what will happen.

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:25.950
That is what I wish to see.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:31.660
Then I... accept.

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:36.120
Very well. Then I shall put things in motion...

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:39.870
But, where in Japan?!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:45.580
Even if it means you must fight that girl.

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:50.000
Hey! Hey, wait up!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.700
Revue of Solitude

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:04.540
The vow from that day slipped from
a hand held confidently aloft, falling into the abyss.

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:11.080
Though it may end in tragedy,
I will once again ascend the stage of fate.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:14.450
Student of the 99th class, Hikari Kagura!

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:18.080
All of this... is for the sake of Starlight!

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:26.830
The sixth day of auditions is a performance
of the "Revue of Solitude."

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:34.620
Now then: sing, dance, and compete
to become the Top Star.

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:01.250
I feel sorry for you, fighting with such a small sword.

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:09.120
I'm sure there've been so many painful things...

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:10.910
But it's all right now.

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:13.370
Because I...

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:17.830
I will take on all of it, for you!

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:28.870
Don't be afraid.

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:34.080
You're already one of us, Hikari-chan!

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:46.950
Sadness, parting, failure...

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:50.660
The agony that comes from being a Stage Girl...

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:54.160
My repeat performance will protect you from all of that!

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:02.250
Karen, what is it that's making you do this?

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:06.120
I made a promise... to Hikari-chan!

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:19.660
Why, Hikari-chan?

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:22.830
What's driving you to go this far?

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:28.200
Karen... and fate. They're both waiting for me!

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:33.660
I thought I'd be able to... brag to Karen, at least a little.

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:37.870
About the stage, and dramas and musicals...

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:42.000
Like, "This is a world that's a little different
from what other girls know."

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:45.410
I wanted to show her that and surprise her.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:49.000
Hikari-chan! Let's go to that stage!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.040
Huh?

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:52.580
Let's both become stars...

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:56.290
We'll all do "Starlight," together!

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:59.660
That's the moment she was born...

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:03.540
The Stage Girl, Hikari Kagura!

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:08.040
I will not... lose again!

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:10.500
I've lost everything, and so for me...

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:14.450
my promise with Karen is what binds me to the stage.

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:21.620
I will become a Stage Girl again. It's for that reason...

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:25.750
My only choice is to defeat all other participants
and become the Top Star!

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:29.700
There's no other way to fulfill my promise to Karen.

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:33.120
Even so... she's such a fool.

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:36.620
This Audition is all about taking,
or having that chance taken from you.

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:40.700
And yet, in order to protect me, she...

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:44.160
We will become stars, together!

00:18:47.160 --> 00:18:49.120
I can't steal Karen's "shine."

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:51.040
And yet...

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:55.870
If I don't defeat all the others, that shine will...!

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:11.370
So then, let's both pass together!

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:17.870
If we both shine the brightest,
we can both pass together, for sure!

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:24.620
If we can shine... together.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:28.200
I'd never even thought of that!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:30.950
But-!

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:43.910
Even so... I could see it.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:50.370
A "Starlight"... for the two of us!

00:19:56.370 --> 00:20:02.370
Act II                                                        The Flower, In Bloom

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:07.160
The Shine... is born anew.

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:24.250
Position Zero!

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:32.660
This concludes the sixth day of auditions.

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:40.500
Did you know, Hikari-chan?

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:44.750
The script dictates that Starlight is a tragedy.

00:21:45.620 --> 00:21:48.580
It must end in parting.

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:52.830
Are you okay parting with Karen-chan?

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:58.000
Even if you one day... you'll have to fight her?

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:06.830
Even so, Karen and I...

00:22:17.700 --> 00:22:25.830
Watashi zutto anata o miteta

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:33.330
Kodoku o oite kita mitai

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:37.200
Koyoi, tsuki mo

00:22:37.200 --> 00:22:41.040
Waraikakeru

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:43.950
Kotchi o muite

00:22:43.950 --> 00:22:49.200
Oh, fly me to the star

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:12.290
Kimochi tsutaeru koto dekinakute

00:23:12.290 --> 00:23:17.620
Ironna jinsei o

00:23:17.620 --> 00:23:19.790
Ukabe

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:23.660
Enjite miru no

00:23:23.660 --> 00:23:27.450
Anata no ki o

00:23:27.450 --> 00:23:30.540
Hikitai kara

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:35.580
Oh, fly me to the star

00:23:49.370 --> 00:23:52.500
A sharp ascent, I'd say.

00:23:53.040 --> 00:23:57.000
Could they be... a destined pair?

00:23:57.410 --> 00:23:58.870
I understand.

00:23:59.740 --> 00:24:04.450
Next Time
On the Night of
the Star Festival

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:03.000
Revue Starlight.

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:04.370
I see.
